      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Network variants",
          "value": "The card is available on both Visa and RuPay. Visa variant is issued as Visa Signature; RuPay variant as RuPay Select. RuPay can be linked to UPI; Visa variant can be tokenised on PhonePe."
        },
        {
          "label": "Contactless",
          "value": "Contactless transactions are allowed up to Rs.5,000 per single transaction without PIN; transactions above Rs.5,000 require PIN."
        },
        {
          "label": "Priority Pass visit charges",
          "value": "USD 27 plus applicable taxes per visit; guest charges are USD 27 plus applicable taxes per visit. The card-specific Priority Pass terms state membership is complimentary for 24 months and for the primary cardholder only."
        },
        {
          "label": "Reward minimum transaction",
          "value": "Reward Points are earned on transactions of minimum Rs.100."
        },
        {
          "label": "Reward accrual timing",
          "value": "Reward Points accrue on posting/settlement date, and the applicable reward cap/structure is determined at transaction posting."
        },
        {
          "label": "Reward forfeiture",
          "value": "Points are immediately forfeited in specified events including dues unpaid for more than 90 days, settlement, fraud, regulatory non-compliance or death; balance is forfeited after 13 consecutive months without a card transaction; specified points are forfeited after two consecutive missed payments; on voluntary closure, unused points are forfeited 30 days after closure."
        },
        {
          "label": "PhonePe accelerated-category identification",
          "value": "Accelerated PhonePe categories are identified using PhonePe MID/TID/VPA on a best-effort basis."
        },
        {
          "label": "UPI restriction effective 2026-07-01",
          "value": "Scan and Pay or online UPI transactions outside PhonePe do not accrue Reward Points from 1 July 2026."
        },
        {
          "label": "Balance transfer",
          "value": "Balance Transfer is available; transferred amount must be at least Rs.5,000 and up to 75% of available credit limit, with applicable processing fee. Indicative processing time in the card booklet is 2-3 working days."
        },
        {
          "label": "Flexipay",
          "value": "Flexipay is available; eligible purchases can be converted within 30 days of purchase. Separate plan-specific interest and processing charges apply."
        },
        {
          "label": "Merchant EMI",
          "value": "Merchant EMI is available at participating merchants/websites; a one-time processing fee may be charged with the first EMI and interest applies according to the selected plan. Merchant EMI transactions do not earn Reward Points."
        },
        {
          "label": "Application channel",
          "value": "The co-branded card application is integrated into the PhonePe app; SBI Card also states that credit-card applications may be made through its website/ILA and other channels."
        },
        {
          "label": "Worldwide acceptance",
          "value": "Card booklet states acceptance at over 29 million outlets globally, including 325,000 outlets in India."
        },
        {
          "label": "Utility fee MCC basis",
          "value": "Utility payments are identified under MCC 4900 on a best-effort basis; network partners define MCCs and may change them."
        },
        {
          "label": "Education payment fee distinction",
          "value": "From 1 November 2025, 1% fee applies to education payments through third-party apps; direct payments to colleges/schools via their websites or POS machines do not attract this fee."
        },
        {
          "label": "Rent fee",
          "value": "Processing fee of Rs.199 applies to all rent payment transactions and is not reversed on transaction reversal/cancellation/refund."
        },
        {
          "label": "Reward redemption",
          "value": "Reward Points can be redeemed against SBI Card Rewards Catalogue vouchers or as credit against statement outstanding; no redemption fee is charged on this card."
        },
        {
          "label": "Welcome voucher mechanics",
          "value": "The Rs.1,500 PhonePe e-Gift Voucher is one-time and tied to payment of the Rs.1,499 annual membership fee; eligible-year definition follows the card membership year, and the voucher is valid for 12 months from addition to Gift Card Balance."
        },
        {
